  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "計算機概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO  COMPUTER AND COMPUTING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的目標在於讓學生認識計算機的軟體與硬體的基本知識，課程主題包括計算機中資料的表示法及使用計算機解決問題的方法。本課程將配合計概實習之教學，並練習使用C++語言作程式設計。",
    "describe_eh": "The goal of this course is to teach students basic concepts of computer software and hardware. The course will focus on data representation in computers and problem solving using computers. The course will be taught with THE PROGRAMMING LABORATORY. Students will practice program design in C++ programming language.",
